  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUsing the GEOBOARD application on your calculator, draw the parallelogram with vertices at (0, 2), (5, 2), (8, 7), and (3, 7).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
  "statementFigure": null,
  "question": null,
  "widgetSlot": null,
  "steps": [
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20034\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qapps.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20034\u0026quot;,108)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20035\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q4.gif\"\u003e to enter the application.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20036\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qapps.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20036\u0026quot;,108)\"\u003e and select \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20037\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q4.gif\"\u003e to start the GEOBOARD application. Press any key to start.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-1 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_4a_80/f-80-4a-1.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSelect a 10 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20038\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 10 square board.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20039\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q4.gif\"\u003e to select a 10 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20040\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 10 square board.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-3 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_4a_80/f-80-4a-2.gif \"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eTurn the axes on.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20041\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qzoom.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20041\u0026quot;,267)\"\u003e (\"FMAT\"), and press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20042\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qdown.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20042\u0026quot;,136)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20043\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qright.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20043\u0026quot;,211)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20044\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20044\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e to turn the axes on. Then press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20045\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qgraph.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20045\u0026quot;,157)\"\u003e (\"QUIT\").\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-5 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_4a_80/f-80-4a-3.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eMove to the point (0, 2). Press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20046\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20046\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e twice (\"DRAW\", then \"ADD\").\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20047\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qup.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20047\u0026quot;,246)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20048\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qup.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20048\u0026quot;,246)\"\u003e to move to the point (0, 2). Then press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20049\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20049\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e twice (\"DRAW\", then \"ADD\").\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThen press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20050\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qright.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20050\u0026quot;,211)\"\u003e five times and press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20051\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20051\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e(\"ADD\") again to draw the segment connecting (0, 2) and (5, 2).\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-7 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_4a_80/f-80-4a-4.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eComplete the parallelogram.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20052\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qright.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20052\u0026quot;,211)\"\u003e three times and \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20053\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qup.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20053\u0026quot;,246)\"\u003e five times, followed by \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20054\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20054\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e (\"ADD\"), to draw the segment connecting (5, 2) and (8, 7).\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThen press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20055\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qleft.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20055\u0026quot;,173)\"\u003e five times followed by \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20056\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20056\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e(\"ADD\") to draw the segment connecting (8, 7) and (3, 7).\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eFinally, press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20057\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qtrace.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20057\u0026quot;,240)\"\u003e (\"DONE\"). We now have our parallelogram.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-9 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_4a_80/f-80-4a-5.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
